  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1d4bd9ce7eb96ea6",
      "translationZh": "工具：Gemini 3.8 TTS 游乐场",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "85aaaccc3db582ed",
      "translationZh": "Google 今天发布了两个新的 Gemini 文本转语音模型 - gemini-3.8-flash-tts 和 gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts 。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6f11cd0c791879f0",
      "translationZh": "它们附带超过 2,000 个声音的库，此外还能通过 \"仅需您声音或您拥有使用权的声音的 30 秒音频样本\" 来创建自定义声音。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78fba08ff7528cf6",
      "translationZh": "我使用 GPT-6 Astra 编写了这个 bring-your-own-key 游乐场界面，利用了底层 Gemini API 的开放 CORS 策略。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4bcad24502fb1d96",
      "translationZh": "API 的一个显著特点是，它使得定义多个角色之间的完整对话变得容易，每个角色都有不同的声音和声音风格指令。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "429032c6981139b9",
      "translationZh": "这是一段两只鹈鹕讨论是否应该搬到 Pacifica Pier 的简短演示片段。我让 Claude 4.5 Opus 编写脚本并使用该工具生成一个渲染 URL。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b58ba4c2f878a",
      "translationZh": "您的浏览器不支持 audio element。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "caf4f7d69444222e",
      "translationZh": "使用 Gemini 3.8 Flash TTS（非更便宜的 Flash-Lite）生成 1 分 18 秒的音频大约用了 20 秒，成本为 2.74 美分。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
